>> numbers := ['1,2,3'] vaevae: [','].
Tuuina-atu tusi: ['I got: '] + numbers aofaiga + [' numbers.'],laina-fou.
{ :i Tuuina-atu tusi: ['number #'] + i + [':'] + (numbers tulaga: i), laina-fou.} × 3.
>> beverages := ['Tea Or Coffee Or Milk Or Orange Juice Or Water'].
beverages := beverages vaevae: [' Or '].
Tuuina-atu tusi: ['We serve'], laina-fou.
{ :i Tuuina-atu tusi: ['->'] + (beverages tulaga: i), laina-fou. } × (beverages aofaiga).
Tuuina-atu tusi: (beverages tuufaatasi: [',']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: (numbers tuufaatasi: ['||']).
